ing space-time patterns: An animation user research</article-title><source>International Journal of Health Geographics</source><year>2006</year><volume>5</volume><fpage>35</fpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16938138</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1186/1476-072X-5-35</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B20"><citation citation-type="other"><person-group person-group-type="author"><collab>OGC</collab></person-group><article-title>Web Map Server Implementation Specification.</article-title><ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://portal.opengeospatial.org/files/index.php?artifact_id=14416"/></citation></ref><ref id="B21"><citation citation-type="other"><person-group person-group-type="author"><collab>OGC</collab></person-group><article-title>Styled Layer   Descriptor Application Profile of the Web Map Service</article-title><ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://portal.opengeospatial.org/files/?artifact_id=22364"/></citation></ref><ref id="B22"><citation citation-type="other"><person-group person-group-type="author"><collab>OGC</collab></person-group><article-title>Web Map Context Documents</article-title><ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://portal.opengeospatial.org/files/?artifact_id=8618"/></citation></ref><ref id="B23"><citation citation-type="other"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Tang</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Zhao</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Coleman</surname><given-names>DJ</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Design of a GIS-enabled Online Discussion Forum for Participatory Planning</article-title><source>Proceedings of the 4th Annual Public Participation GIS Conference, Cleveland State University, Cleveland, Ohio, USA, August 2005</source><ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://downloads2.esri.com/campus/uploads/library/pdfs/55426.pdf"/></citation></ref><ref id="B24"><citation citation-type="other"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Zhao</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Coleman</surname><given-names>DJ</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>GeoDF: Towards a SDI-based PPGIS application for E-Governance</article-title><source>Proceedings of the GSDI 9 Conference, Santiago, Chile, 6&#x02013;10 November 2006</source><ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://gsdidocs.org/gsdiconf/GSDI-9/papers/TS9.3paper.pdf"/></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>